H42, arm extension through a straight line: measured and not adopted.

Kept so the work is not lost. It was written against the tree of 2026-11-06,
before the fixes in H44, so it may not apply cleanly now. Why it was not
adopted is in ROADMAP.md, H42.

Apply with: git apply docs/history/h42-arm-extension-line.patch

